    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/699743e83664d01b39901a1834aa7a5d.avif?t=1727257987\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carry Forward Human Civilization in a Thriving Ocean World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where Earth's magnetic field is in crisis, humanity sends out &quot;Pioneers&quot; to find a new home. As one of these explorers, you'll arrive on an ocean planet 15 light years away and embark on an unknown adventure. In this ocean-covered corner of the universe, you are humanity's last hope to build a new home and continue the legacy of Earth's civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/3527d9b973c57830a593cbfcd381a868.poster.avif?t=1727257987\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/3527d9b973c57830a593cbfcd381a868.webm?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/3527d9b973c57830a593cbfcd381a868.mp4?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild Industrial Order in the Dark Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the ocean planet, you'll need to survive and establish a complete industrial system. Automate construction and manage intelligent resource gathering and production. Use dozens of futuristic machines, factories, and transport systems to build a complex and efficient industrial network, laying the foundation for the revival of human civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/c02db862358516624b4b89d3f194f520.poster.avif?t=1727257987\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/c02db862358516624b4b89d3f194f520.webm?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/c02db862358516624b4b89d3f194f520.mp4?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Countless Mysteries on a Blue Alien Planet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ocean-covered planet is full of mysteries. Each exploration brings new discoveries and challenges with randomly generated environments, rich story missions, alternating day and night, and complex weather. From faster-than-light travel to wormhole technology, building interstellar portals, and encountering unique underwater creatures, all secrets await you in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/09768878a858d0037f0d626a08ffbca2.poster.avif?t=1727257987\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/09768878a858d0037f0d626a08ffbca2.webm?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/09768878a858d0037f0d626a08ffbca2.mp4?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carry Forward Human Civilization in a Thriving Ocean World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where Earth's magnetic field is in crisis, humanity sends out &quot;Pioneers&quot; to find a new home. As one of these explorers, you'll arrive on an ocean planet 15 light years away and embark on an unknown adventure. In this ocean-covered corner of the universe, you are humanity's last hope to build a new home and continue the legacy of Earth's civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/3527d9b973c57830a593cbfcd381a868.poster.avif?t=1727257987\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/3527d9b973c57830a593cbfcd381a868.webm?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/3527d9b973c57830a593cbfcd381a868.mp4?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild Industrial Order in the Dark Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the ocean planet, you'll need to survive and establish a complete industrial system. Automate construction and manage intelligent resource gathering and production. Use dozens of futuristic machines, factories, and transport systems to build a complex and efficient industrial network, laying the foundation for the revival of human civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/c02db862358516624b4b89d3f194f520.poster.avif?t=1727257987\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/c02db862358516624b4b89d3f194f520.webm?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/c02db862358516624b4b89d3f194f520.mp4?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Countless Mysteries on a Blue Alien Planet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ocean-covered planet is full of mysteries. Each exploration brings new discoveries and challenges with randomly generated environments, rich story missions, alternating day and night, and complex weather. From faster-than-light travel to wormhole technology, building interstellar portals, and encountering unique underwater creatures, all secrets await you in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/09768878a858d0037f0d626a08ffbca2.poster.avif?t=1727257987\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/09768878a858d0037f0d626a08ffbca2.webm?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752350/extras/09768878a858d0037f0d626a08ffbca2.mp4?t=1727257987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
